=========================================
AssimpLoader Auto-Test Loop
=========================================

This script will:
  1. Build and deploy the mod
  2. Launch the game
  3. Wait for crash or success
  4. Write status to test-status.txt
  5. Claude monitors and fixes issues
  6. Repeat until stable

Max iterations: 10
Crash wait timeout: 60 seconds

